<title>HONG KONG: Hanil Bank HK sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Hanil Bank HK sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by Sakura Finance Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER HANIL BANK HONG KONG BRANCH	GUARANTOR --</p>
<p> AMT	HK$500 MLN COUPON     1MH+30     MATURITY    364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	 ISS PRICE  PAR	  RE-OFFER    99.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	 CALLS	NONE	 PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS	HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATINGS  A3	   SALES LMTS CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	  CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HONG KONG  HOME CTRY  S.KOREA    TAX PROV    --</p>
<p> FEES     8 BP	 MGT,UND    --	   SELLING     --</p>
<p> LEADS    CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA (BOOKS), SAKURA FINANCE ASIA</p>
<p>CO-LEADS COMMONWEALTH BANK OF AUSTRALIA, HSBC MARKETS, LTCB</p>
<p>	    ASIA, NIPPON CREDIT IN'L HK, UBS</p>
<p> NOTES    ***THE ISSUE IS NOW FREE TO TRADE***</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
